msgstr "API 参考"

#: ../../source/controllers/stackchan.rst:307
msgid ""
"StackChan board driver: SCS serial servos on UART, RGB and servo power on"
" M5IOE1, Si12T touch, INA226 (battery bus), and onboard NFC "
"(``ST25R3916``) as :class:`unit.nfc.NFCUnit`."
msgstr ""
"StackChan 板级驱动：包括 UART 上的 SCS 串口舵机、M5IOE1 上的 RGB 和舵机供电、Si12T "
"触摸、INA226（电池总线），以及作为 :class:`unit.nfc.NFCUnit` 的板载 NFC（``ST25R3916``）。"

#: ../../source/controllers/stackchan.rst:309
msgid ""
"The class is a **singleton**; always construct with the same ``i2c`` and "
"``uart`` ids."
msgstr "该类是**单例**；请始终使用相同的 ``i2c`` 和 ``uart`` id 进行构造。"

#: ../../source/controllers/stackchan.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/controllers/stackchan.rst:311
msgid "``I2C`` peripheral id."
msgstr "``I2C`` 外设 id。"

#: ../../source/controllers/stackchan.rst:312
msgid "``UART`` id for the 1 Mbaud servo bus."
msgstr "用于 1 Mbaud 舵机总线的 ``UART`` id。"

#: ../../source/controllers/stackchan.rst:314
msgid ""
"After init, the instance exposes ``nfc`` (a :class:`unit.nfc.NFCUnit`—see"
" `NFC Unit <../unit/nfc.html>`__ for the complete API), ``touch``, "
"``i2c``, and low-level ``servo`` (``Scscl`` instance) for advanced use."
msgstr ""

